  "settings": {
    "letter-date": "Date: 5 August 2026",
    "letter-subject": "INVITATION TO PARTICIPATE IN THE DALP EDUCATION EXPO SERIES",
    "letter-salutation": "Dear Sir/Madam",
    "sender-name": "Dr. Patrick Nkhoma",
    "sender-designation": "Managing Director",
    "currentTemplate": "exact",
    "includeSignature": true,
    "letter-body": "<!--StartFragment--><p>On behalf of DALP Consultancy Services Limited, we are pleased to invite your institution to participate in our upcoming Education Expo Series, designed to connect international institutions with prospective students, parents, school representatives, and education stakeholders across Zambia.</p><p>Our upcoming expos will be held as follows:</p><p><strong>18 September 2026</strong>  </p><p><strong>Venue:</strong> EDU Hub Conference Centre, Lusaka</p><p><strong>12 February 2027</strong>  </p><p><strong>Venue:</strong> Lusaka</p><p><strong>13 February 2027</strong>  </p><p><strong>Venue:</strong> Garden Court Hotel, Kitwe</p><p>For the Kitwe Expo, participants will fly from Lusaka to Ndola on the morning of 13 February 2027, where our team will receive them and provide road transportation to the venue in Kitwe. At the conclusion of the event, participants will be transported back to Ndola for their return flight to Lusaka later that evening.</p><h3>Participation Options</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>USD 500</strong> – Participation in any one expo.</li>\n<li><strong>USD 750</strong> – Participation in both the Lusaka and Kitwe expos in February 2027.</li>\n<li><strong>USD 250</strong> – Proxy representation, where our team will represent your institution if you are unable to attend in person.</li></ul><p>Kindly confirm your participation and preferred option by <strong>14 August 2026</strong> to assist us with our planning and logistics.</p><p>We would be honoured to welcome your institution to our Education Expo Series and look forward to partnering with you to inspire the next generation of international students.</p><p>Yours sincerely,</p><!--EndFragment-->",
    "autoPersonalizeSalutation": true
  },
